	measure Previous1 = ```
			
			var maxdate=SELECTEDVALUE(Calendar5pm[Date])
			VAR PrevDate = 
			CALCULATE(
			    MAX( Calendar5pm[Date] ),
			    FILTER(
			        ALL( Calendar5pm ),
			        Calendar5pm[Date] < maxdate
			    )
			) 
			    
			RETURN
			     PrevDate 
			
			```
		formatString: General Date
		lineageTag: e361c512-dac5-4392-a14e-1a891e27878a

